Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:16.58,TITLE,,0,0,0,,{\c&H898989&\fs40\frz30\pos(934,283)}遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:16.58,TITLE,,0,0,0,,{\c&H898989&\fs40\frz31\pos(1006,417)}漫畫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:16.58,TITLE,,0,0,0,,{\c&H898989&\fs40\frz31\pos(1137,610)}電影
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:16.58,TITLE,,0,0,0,,{\c&H898989&\fs50\frz31\pos(951,850)}社團活動
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:16.58,TITLE,,0,0,0,,{\c&H898989&\fs40\frz28\pos(1347,741)}信息處理社
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:16.58,TITLE,,0,0,0,,{\c&H898989&\fs40\frz28\pos(1386,834)}直接回家{\fs36}（因為要上補習班）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.18,0:20:05.18,TITLE,,0,0,250,,{\blur5}「山田」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:14.65,TITLE,,0,0,250,,{\blur5}「喜歡我」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.82,0:20:56.32,TITLE,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\pos(1206,492)}「山田喜歡我」
